			<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif">Please note, it is the responsibility of owners to arrange their own Customs Clearance. For more information regarding this process please refer to your animal transport company or refer to Australian Border Force , TEL: 1300 558 099<br />
			<br />
			If your dog/cat is a personal pet and over 12 months of age, customs processing can be undertaken by owners. Our team will direct you to “Customs House” for arrival clearance processing.<br />
